		"School BB Gun and every practice tool address only the room-owned Disposition Dummy. Can't leave classroom, enter inventory, target a Resident, target ordinary NPC, cause damage, or create blood.", 
		"Down the dummy first. Then choose nonpermanent disposition, Attempt Lasting Injury, or fatality. Label is Lasting Injury because consequence outlasts the argument.", 
